{"pin":"AB01507","subcodes":[{"code":"AB01507","anchor":"","first_line":"O thou old friend! A month ago a letter was written to the favored maidservant... The Covenant of God is like unto a vast and fathomless ocean.","first_line_orig":"امروز هر عاقل هوشیاری و عاقبت‌بینی بیدار شود و واقف اسرار مستقبل گردد که جز قوّهٴ میثاق قلب آفاقرا بحرکت نیارد  ","language":"Per","word_count":"320","translations":[],"writing_refs":[{"type":"swab","type_name":"Selections from the Writings of 'Abdu'l-Bahá","language":"fa","lang_name":"Persian"},{"type":"swab","type_name":"Selections from the Writings of 'Abdu'l-Bahá","language":"en","lang_name":"English"},{"type":"swab","type_name":"Selections from the Writings of 'Abdu'l-Bahá","language":"orig","lang_name":"Original"}],"refs":[{"kind":"publication","code":"MMK1#189 p.216x","source":"MMK1","locator":"189 p.216x","url":"https://www.bahai.org/r/195038567"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MMK5#095 p.080x","source":"MMK5","locator":"095 p.080x","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/ab/SWA5/swa5-83.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MNMK#128 p.243x","source":"MNMK","locator":"128 p.243x","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/ab/MMAB/mmab-241.html"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BSC.547 #988x","source":"BSC","locator":"547 #988x","url":"http://bahai-library.com/compilations/bahai.scriptures/"},{"kind":"translation","code":"SWAB#189x","source":"SWAB","locator":"189x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/327789342"},{"kind":"translation","code":"SW_v10#08 p.153","source":"SW_v10","locator":"08 p.153","url":"https://bahai.works/Star_of_the_West/Volume_10/Issue_8"}]}]}
